sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: State is EnergyTransferStarted

    Note over CS,CSMS: 1. Execute Reusable State EVDisconnected<br>Executed after the configured transaction duration is reached<br>This causes the transaction to stop
    Note right of CS: The TransactionEventRequest containing eventType Ended contains the MeterValue field<br>timestamp: intervals between the timestamps of the Meter Values equal the configured clock-aligned Tx ended Meter Values interval<br>sampledValue.context is Sample.Periodic AND the last one has Transaction.End<br>sampledValue.signedMeterValue is Generated SignedMeterValueType
